{"uid":"20f5298049d90f15","name":"test_ensure_petitions_file_never_creates_in_an_empty_workspace","fullName":"tests.test_petitions#test_ensure_petitions_file_never_creates_in_an_empty_workspace","historyId":"9ce08d4ac0e1f57e48c91a2973953725","time":{"start":1791919169223,"stop":1791919169224,"duration":1},"description":"H.2 (#200): `ensure_petitions_file` was the one remaining callable\n    petition writer with a tree-creating fallback, left behind once task\n    008 retired the two production writers' own workspace fallbacks -- the\n    review probe (`review_checks.py::test_h_ensure_petitions_file_does_\n    not_create_in_workspace`) called it directly against an empty\n    workspace and found a brand-new `artifacts/reports/v0.21-petitions.md`\n    created on disk. This is that same probe, inlined: an entirely empty\n    workspace stays entirely empty -- no new file, no new directory --\n    whether or not the contract text names a wave or declares the\n    petition protocol at all. It also covers the two related shapes in\n    one function rather than three, to avoid growing the fast tier's own\n    collected-test ceiling any further than this one regression must\n    (`cure-01-04` is the task that brings that ceiling back down):\n    returning an EXISTING current-wave file unwritten, and creating\n    nothing beside a lone OLDER-wave file either.","descriptionHtml":"<p>H.2 (#200): <code>ensure_petitions_file</code> was the one remaining callable<br />\npetition writer with a tree-creating fallback, left behind once task<br />\n008 retired the two production writers' own workspace fallbacks -- the<br />\nreview probe (<code>review_checks.py::test_h_ensure_petitions_file_does_ not_create_in_workspace</code>) called it directly against an empty<br />\nworkspace and found a brand-new <code>artifacts/reports/v0.21-petitions.md</code><br />\ncreated on disk. This is that same probe, inlined: an entirely empty<br />\nworkspace stays entirely empty -- no new file, no new directory --<br />\nwhether or not the contract text names a wave or declares the<br />\npetition protocol at all. It also covers the two related shapes in<br />\none function rather than three, to avoid growing the fast tier's own<br />\ncollected-test ceiling any further than this one regression must<br />\n(<code>cure-01-04</code> is the task that brings that ceiling back down):<br />\nreturning an EXISTING current-wave file unwritten, and creating<br />\nnothing beside a lone OLDER-wave file either.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791919169215,"stop":1791919169215,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791919169215,"stop":1791919169217,"duration":2},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791919169217,"stop":1791919169217,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791919169218,"stop":1791919169220,"duration":2},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_wait_out_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791919169220,"stop":1791919169220,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasCon